{
	"name": "LoadoutMenu",
	"_doc": "The loadout menu (src/client/Menus): opens after Play and on every death; the class list on the left (one row per Config/Classes.List entry, the rows here are samples), the soldier you'll spawn as on the right (a ViewportFrame of the server's preview rig). Marks show only here (user 2026-10-27). Back returns to the title screen (user 2026-10-27: \"we need a back button\"). Deploy lights up when the respawn delay is over. Change team (only in modes that keep teams: Config/Modes `teams`, or the admin panel's dev switch) opens three team cards (user 2026-10-27): a gradient placeholder for the team's art, its name and 'count / room' in the middle; the text is white if you can join, red if you can't, grey for your team. A joinable card asks for a second click (joining resets your Marks).",
